# Lock icons used in:
# - clayitemtreeview.c as button-icon-size (in our system theme
#   ClayEditor-button-icon-size is set to "menu", i.e. 16px) column
#   header image.
# - clayitemtreeview.c as ClayCellRendererToggle (16px) and as
#   button-icon-size image in a GtkToggleButton (16px).
# - Various action icons (usually 16px).
clay-lock
clay-lock-multi
clay-lock-alpha
clay-lock-content
clay-lock-path
clay-lock-position
clay-lock-visibility
